WEBVTT

1
00:00:00,590 --> 00:00:02,910
My home is in Hubei. My name is Gao Zhiqiang.

2
00:00:02,910 --> 00:00:04,390
I used to be a soldier

3
00:00:04,390 --> 00:00:05,750
Later, I switched to butchering pigs.

4
00:00:05,750 --> 00:00:07,110
Later he opened a restaurant by himself

5
00:00:07,110 --> 00:00:08,550
It’s not right to call veteran barbecue

6
00:00:08,550 --> 00:00:12,470
Call me an old pig or a fat man?

7
00:00:12,470 --> 00:00:15,910
Why are you so nervous? You can't be a great man, right? Brother Lin

8
00:00:15,910 --> 00:00:17,070
I always feel flustered

9
00:00:17,070 --> 00:00:18,230
Like interrogating a prisoner

10
00:00:18,230 --> 00:00:20,230
But I'm not a great man, I really am not

11
00:00:20,230 --> 00:00:28,720
This rope will strangle me to death Jiang Yun

12
00:00:29,430 --> 00:00:31,550
Not all great men have to be scared to become great men

13
00:00:31,550 --> 00:00:32,880
Brother Jiang

14
00:00:32,880 --> 00:00:37,900
He is not a great man

15
00:00:37,900 --> 00:00:39,580
I want to recruit great people with this trick

16
00:00:40,180 --> 00:00:41,460
How ridiculous

17
00:00:41,780 --> 00:00:43,420
It's up to Brother Lin Yang to find a way

18
00:00:43,420 --> 00:00:44,580
I believe in Brother Lin Yang
